# What must never be uploaded to Vercel.
#
# Both Vercel projects in this repository deploy from the repository root: the
# delivery app builds locally and ships `--prebuilt`, and the grading service
# has `rootDirectory: apps/university-grading` set on the project, which makes
# a `--prebuilt` deploy from that subdirectory resolve its path twice and ship
# a build with no function in it. That deploy has to upload sources instead,
# and without this file it uploads 1.4GB of installed dependencies.
#
# Vercel installs dependencies and builds on its own side, so none of this is
# needed there.
node_modules
.git
.vercel/output
dist
build
.turbo
coverage
playwright-report
test-results
.scratch
apps/university/dist
apps/local/studies
